WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.540 --> 00:00:07.590
every now and then the women folk of our&nbsp;
town like to enjoy a day off from bending&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:07.590 --> 00:00:12.330
over a hot kitchen stove and scrubbing dirty&nbsp;
dishes we don't have to search for an answer&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:12.330 --> 00:00:17.280
to that desire because we have sufficient&nbsp;
restaurants with nice atmosphere and good&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:17.280 --> 00:00:22.410
clean wholesome food at reasonable prices&nbsp;
right in our own community the men may&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:22.410 --> 00:00:27.270
grumble at the suggestion let's heat out&nbsp;
tonight but just watch them enjoy that food

00:01:00.790 --> 00:01:06.550
feel safe and proud of our municipal government&nbsp;
for it is through this force that our town is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:06.550 --> 00:01:12.100
kept in order and protected from unlawful&nbsp;
and disrupting influences it's a mighty good&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:12.100 --> 00:01:17.290
feeling to know they are always on the job to&nbsp;
make our town a better place in which to live

00:01:42.530 --> 00:01:48.950
we are proud of our excellent schools that&nbsp;
provide the education of our children proud&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:48.950 --> 00:01:54.620
of its part toward preparing our use for facing&nbsp;
the future our schools are properly organized&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:54.620 --> 00:02:00.350
with able staffs educated to guide and teach&nbsp;
these future young men and women of tomorrow

00:03:23.530 --> 00:03:30.340
our town looks with pride to its fine automobile&nbsp;
agencies and services beautiful new cars are&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:30.340 --> 00:03:37.090
rolling off the assembly lines daily offering&nbsp;
more room more style more convenience longer&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:37.090 --> 00:03:42.520
service and lasting quality our dealers are&nbsp;
doing their utmost to put as many new cars&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:42.520 --> 00:03:48.070
on our streets as possible here as everywhere&nbsp;
else we have waited for these necessities and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:48.070 --> 00:03:53.830
luxuries and now we can feel sure that we will&nbsp;
be supplied with finer products than ever before

00:04:09.210 --> 00:04:14.880
our service clubs might well be called the&nbsp;
backbone of our town for it is through them&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:14.880 --> 00:04:20.670
that our business and social activities are&nbsp;
welded together their noble and unselfish&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:20.670 --> 00:04:25.080
efforts are aimed at making ours a&nbsp;
better town in which to live and work&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:25.080 --> 00:04:30.510
through these clubs many a good deed&nbsp;
has been bestowed upon our fellow man

